# Paper 2 draft and its supporting figures/data - kept locally only, not
# published or committed. Ignored (not deleted) specifically so a future
# `git reset --hard` / `git clean -fd` can't wipe them again the way it did
# on 2026-09-22 (they were untracked-and-not-ignored back then - that was
# the actual root cause, not the reset command itself). If these ever are
# meant to be committed, remove the relevant line below first - don't
# `git add -f` around this file.
docs/paper2_draft.tex
docs/paper2_draft.md
docs/paper_outline.md
docs/figures/
docs/data/
